# Guard: brain/ops docs belong in fourier-basis (private), never in this public repo
41CHAN_MASTER_REFERENCE.md
CLAUDE.md
devlog-fourier-*.md
*.bak
*.bak.*

# ...except the deployed build's configuration. It holds no secret -- a public
# OAuth client id and a homeserver URL, both readable in any built bundle -- and
# keeping it untracked is what let a rebuild from a clean clone fall back to the
# DEVWEB defaults and break login on tc.41chan.net.
!.env.production
